        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Network containment parents resources: VNet &amp;gt; subnet &amp;gt; resource deployed into it.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; A resource in another resource group than its VNet (private endpoint, gateway) stays in its subnet; its resource group is in its label.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; PaaS reached through a private endpoint stays outside the VNet; only the endpoint NIC is in the subnet.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; App Service with regional VNet integration stays outside the VNet, with an outbound edge into its delegated subnet.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Zone-redundant resources are labelled with their zones; a subnet is never inside a zone frame.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Every edge carries a label. Evidence labels are in the companion report." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend">
